          "type": "Int"
        },
        {
          "name": "Func",
          "type": "ProcessFunc"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "template<ProcessFunc> void",
      "docs": "Call an external lambda with a reference to the grid value at (I,J,K).\nCalled as Func(ElemType&), so the caller can both read and write the grid cell.\nNote: if doing pure reads prefer the GetValue() methods because the ProcessValue method will allocate the underlying data block."
